%% Receiving document status transitions (PRD §6, BR-07, BR-10, BR-11, BR-12, BR-15)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OPEN : create document (operator / supervisor)
    OPEN --> PARTIALLY_RECEIVED : receipt, not all items full
    OPEN --> FULLY_RECEIVED : receipt fills every item
    PARTIALLY_RECEIVED --> PARTIALLY_RECEIVED : receipt, still not all items full
    PARTIALLY_RECEIVED --> FULLY_RECEIVED : receipt fills the last open item(s)
    FULLY_RECEIVED --> COMPLETED : supervisor completes (BR-10)
    OPEN --> CANCELLED : supervisor cancels (BR-11, nothing received)
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    note right of COMPLETED : Terminal (BR-12)
    note right of CANCELLED : Terminal (BR-12)
